※ pl4g-test: compile=error diag=5303
※ pl4g-test: args -shared
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 5303 LANG_SHARED_VISIBLE_CONVENTION

※ A shared object offers its visible functions to programs compiled by
※ something else, which call the way the system calls.  One of this compiler's
※ own convention would be called in a way it does not expect, so it has to say
※ `@[cdecl]`, or `@[abi]` with the convention it follows.

@[visible]
fn offered(n: i64) → i64:
    n
